  "scope": "Default-off HTTP/stdio client on the canonical af7c059 foundation. This is not production enablement, final composed-main/release acceptance, suspend acceptance, or ordinary browser/unmodified arbitrary TCP completion.",
  "findings_fixed": [
    "Admission watcher now closes the owned TCP connection on cancellation and joins before handing it to the application; 15s deadline covers both auth write and ACK.",
    "Already-canceled HTTP/raw entry refuses before application dispatch/read.",
    "Informational responses are consumed until final, with at most7 accepted interim responses and one aggregate16KiB informational/final header budget; upgrades refused. LF terminators cannot make large bodies count as initial headers.",
    "Typed remote_outcome_unknown errors preserve uncertainty through top-level interrupted reporting."
  ],
